# Archived toolpaths from tools/overhang_report.py. Several hundred megabytes
# for a full matrix, and regenerable by re-running. They exist so a change to
# the metrics can be re-scored with --reanalyse instead of re-slicing, which is
# a local concern; the JSON reports are the committed artifact.
reports/toolpaths/

# Per-run stdout from tools/run_matrix_parallel.py. One file per run, kept so a
# failure can be diagnosed after the fact; local diagnostics, not an artifact.
reports/worker_logs/
